WEBVTT

00:10:29.402 --> 00:10:30.471
How can we achieve this?

00:10:30.495 --> 00:10:33.918
To be honest, we don't know.

00:10:33.942 --> 00:10:36.052
(Laughter)

00:10:36.076 --> 00:10:38.466
That's the reason why, for a long time,

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:42.123
chefs from around the world
have been working together,

00:10:42.147 --> 00:10:43.814
each of us in our own field,

00:10:43.838 --> 00:10:48.135
to reach the goal
of spreading this message --

00:10:48.159 --> 00:10:50.337
and not waiting for the governments.

00:10:51.027 --> 00:10:54.613
For example, here in New York,
Dan Barber, in his Blue Hill,

00:10:54.637 --> 00:10:56.025
very close to New York City,

00:10:56.049 --> 00:10:58.490
has been fighting for a long time

00:10:58.514 --> 00:11:02.154
to show that a diverse
and sustainable agriculture